'''Can-Can Canal''' is the fourth stage in [[New World Ehen]]. It introduces [[THE FOLIVOREAN]] and [[Suidae Piggicus]] to [[Zero Legends]] alongside a new enemy: [[Lophiiformes Angaburu]].

